Package: spacsysr
Title: Core Biogeochemical Process Modules of the SPACSYS Model
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: person("qingfeng", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "qingfeng@example.com",
             comment = "TODO: replace with your real email")
Description: An R implementation of the core soil-plant biogeochemical process
    modules described in the SPACSYS technical manual (Wu, 2022, ver. 6.00).
    Provides response functions (temperature, moisture, pH), soil organic matter
    decomposition, nitrification and denitrification (simplified and
    microbiological process-based formulations), nitrogenous gas emissions
    (N2O, NO), ammonia volatilisation, methane production and oxidation, plant
    respiration, a tipping-bucket soil water balance, and a simplified daily
    driver that couples the modules across soil layers, plus a simplified
    ("lite") daily integrated model coupling soil water, C/N cycling and
    RUE-based crop growth with water/nitrogen stress responses. Pure base
    R, no dependencies.
